                "description": "Schlage B60BRK, Brookshire Single Cylinder Deadbolt - The Brookshire Single Cylinder Deadbolt features a lovely and ornate rose that really will bring a sense of grandeur to any door. It fits standard door cutouts and is adjustable for 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets on doors that are 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches thick. This grade 1 single cylinder deadbolt is easy to operate; the bolt is thrown and retracted by either a thumbturn from the inside or a key from the outside. ",
